          "result_latex": "\\{4,10\\}",
          "derivation": "On x>=4 the product is defined. x-10=0 gives 10; the principal root is zero exactly when x-4=0, giving 4. Both are admissible."
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "ordinal": 2,
